# Third-party notices - Heart of Magic Librarian @PROJECT_VERSION@

## Licenses

- **The plugin DLLs are a GPL-3.0-or-later combined work.** `SKSE/Plugins/SpellLearning.dll`,
  `SKSE/Plugins/SL_BookXP.dll` and `optional/ISLPatch/SKSE/Plugins/DontEatSpellTomes.dll` statically link
  **CommonLibSSE-NG 10.0.0**, which is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later with the **Modding Exception** and the
  **GPL-3.0 Linking Exception**. The DLLs are distributed under those terms:
  `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/COPYING.txt` (GNU GPL version 3) and `licenses/CommonLibSSE-NG/EXCEPTIONS.md`
  (the two exceptions).
- **Heart of Magic Librarian's own source files are MIT** (`LICENSE` next to this file): the C++ in the
  repository's `plugins/` (except the `external/` submodule), the Papyrus scripts, the PrismaUI panel and
  the runtime data. MIT is compatible with the GPL; files you take from this project on their own stay MIT.

## Corresponding Source

The complete Corresponding Source for the DLLs is public at
<https://github.com/Iwillbewarlock/HeartOfMagic>, tag `v@PROJECT_VERSION@` (the tag of this release).
CommonLibSSE-NG is its git submodule `plugins/external/commonlibsse-ng` at tag `v10.0.0`
(<https://github.com/alandtse/CommonLibVR>, branch `ng`); `git submodule update --init --recursive`
fetches it. The third-party libraries below come from the vcpkg manifest `vcpkg.json`. Building:
`BuildRelease.ps1` (see the repository's README and CLAUDE.md).

## Libraries in the DLLs

Linked statically or compiled in from headers (vcpkg triplet `x64-windows-static`). Their license
texts are in `licenses/`.

